      "label": "The Street"
    }
  },
  "_comment_scenes": "A manifest that declares `scenes` REPLACES the display's built-in fantasy set for campaigns on this system; a system that declares none keeps the built-in scenes. Object order is priority order (an exact score tie goes to the earlier scene). Keywords are matched as whole words and scored with the same margin and incumbent bonus as the built-in set. `particles` must be a type the renderer draws (PARTICLE_COUNT in display/templates/index.html).",
